# Build-time settings for the web front end. Copy to `.env` or set them in the build environment.

# Base URL of the API when it is not served from the same origin.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Public ref of the record shown as the example on the home page: a molecule entry (spe_...) or a
# reaction entry (rxe_...). When it is unset, malformed, not found or hidden under the curated
# profile, the home page shows a "Browse molecules" link instead of the example.
# VITE_HOME_EXAMPLE_REF=
